    "description": {
      "value": "<p>你选择沼泽作为大地结社的地形。达到表中等级时，获得对应的结社法术。这些法术始终准备，不计入你的每日准备法术上限，对你而言视为德鲁伊法术。</p>\n<table> <thead><tr> <th> <p><strong>德鲁伊等级</strong></p> </th> <th> <p><strong>结社法术</strong></p> </th> </tr> </thead><tbody><tr> <td> <p>3rd</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.UyQ9nYcQlFdEbmeV]{黑暗术}</em><em>darkness</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.jR5afVVOCCwjkbz2]{马友夫强酸箭}</em><em>acid arrow</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>5th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.fpEiFPEnSjOGP7wy]{水上行走}</em><em>water walk</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.GensV9GQoTT2acka]{臭云术}</em><em>stinking cloud</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>7th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.OZMc9g7XaWuRc36J]{行动自如}</em><em>freedom of movement</em><em>，</em></p> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.s9CC5wvKMHq42hPY]{生物定位术}</em><em>locate creature</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>9th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.eGYMgP3fmIUQEXMm]{疫病虫群}</em><em>insect plague</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.OA4mCsVxg6nUrLjV]{探知}术</em><em>scrying</em></p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table>",
